    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c01d6e4033df404986690d95dbbdb396",
      "statement": "Footfall anchors are now authorable per clip as a gait phase clip component, but they do not yet reach the generated database: extraction still derives its own contacts and Python still reconstructs phase from them, so the component changes what a person can see and correct rather than what a network trains on.",
